{"script":"yd_012_03-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]在尚未干掉猎物之前，猎人可以采取一切手段让猎物失去抵抗能力。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]但在让猎物失去抵抗能力之后，猎人要妥善处理手上的猎物，不要干其他残忍的事情。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]具体来说，干掉猎物的手段最好是干净利索的，不要让猎物承受太多的痛苦，更不要去进行虐待。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]世界万物皆有生灵，不管是能思考的还是不能思考的生物。[r]我们无法避免弱肉强食，但我们可以避免更多悲剧的出现。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]当然我这说这一切的前提是猎物已经失去了抵抗能力。如果猎人尚在捕捉的过程中，倒也不必太在乎这一点。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"沃夫加-猎物的生灵"}